  <div class="main-content-container" style="z-index:5;position:relative;"><p style="tab-size:26.66px;font-size:10pt;margin-top:9pt;font-family:Arial;margin-bottom:0;text-align:justify;"><span style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;">Operating income included a favorable foreign currency impact of 2%.</span></p><p style="tab-size:26.66px;font-size:10pt;margin-top:13.5pt;font-family:Arial;margin-bottom:0;text-align:left;"><span style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-weight:bold;font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial;font-style:italic;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;">Fiscal Year 2025 Compared with Fiscal Year 2024</span><span style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-weight:bold;font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial;font-style:italic;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;"> </span></p><p style="tab-size:26.66px;font-size:10pt;margin-top:9pt;font-family:Arial;margin-bottom:0;text-align:left;"><span style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial;font-style:italic;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;">Agents and Infra</span></p><p style="tab-size:26.66px;font-size:10pt;margin-top:9pt;font-family:Arial;margin-bottom:0;text-align:justify;"><span style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;">Revenue increased $31.9 billion or 17%.</span></p><div class="item-list-element-wrapper" style="margin-left:5.731%;tab-size:32px;display:flex;font-size:10pt;margin-top:4.5pt;justify-content:flex-start;font-family:Arial;align-items:baseline;margin-bottom:0;min-width:3.333%;text-align:justify;"><span style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:10pt;font-family:Times New Roman;font-kerning:none;min-width:3.5356267702001714%;word-break:keep-all;display:inline-flex;justify-content:flex-start;">&#8226;</span><div style="display:inline;"><span style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;">Azure revenue increased $18.5 billion or 34% driven by demand for our portfolio of services.</span></div></div><div class="item-list-element-wrapper" style="margin-left:5.731%;tab-size:32px;display:flex;font-size:10pt;margin-top:4.5pt;justify-content:flex-start;font-family:Arial;align-items:baseline;margin-bottom:0;min-width:3.333%;text-align:justify;"><span style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:10pt;font-family:Times New Roman;font-kerning:none;min-width:3.5356267702001714%;word-break:keep-all;display:inline-flex;justify-content:flex-start;">&#8226;</span><div style="display:inline;"><span style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;">Microsoft 365 cloud revenue increased $11.1 billion or 15% driven by Microsoft 365 commercial cloud. Microsoft 365 commercial cloud revenue increased 15% with growth in revenue per user, as well as Microsoft 365 commercial seat growth of 7% driven by small and medium businesses and frontline worker offerings. Microsoft 365 consumer cloud revenue increased 11% driven by Microsoft 365 consumer subscriber growth of 8% to 89.0 million, as well as growth in revenue per user from the price increase announced in January 2025.</span></div></div><div class="item-list-element-wrapper" style="margin-left:5.731%;tab-size:32px;display:flex;font-size:10pt;margin-top:4.5pt;justify-content:flex-start;font-family:Arial;align-items:baseline;margin-bottom:0;min-width:3.333%;text-align:justify;"><span style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:10pt;font-family:Times New Roman;font-kerning:none;min-width:3.5356267702001714%;word-break:keep-all;display:inline-flex;justify-content:flex-start;">&#8226;</span><div style="display:inline;"><span style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;">Productivity and server licensing revenue increased $415 million or 1% driven by Microsoft 365 commercial products. </span></div></div><div class="item-list-element-wrapper" style="margin-left:5.731%;tab-size:32px;display:flex;font-size:10pt;margin-top:4.5pt;justify-content:flex-start;font-family:Arial;align-items:baseline;margin-bottom:0;min-width:3.333%;text-align:justify;"><span style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:10pt;font-family:Times New Roman;font-kerning:none;min-width:3.5356267702001714%;word-break:keep-all;display:inline-flex;justify-content:flex-start;">&#8226;</span><div style="display:inline;"><span style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;">Industry solutions revenue increased $1.6 billion or 10% driven by growth in Industry solutions cloud. Industry solutions cloud revenue increased 11% driven by Dynamics 365 with growth across all workloads.</span></div></div><div class="item-list-element-wrapper" style="margin-left:5.731%;tab-size:32px;display:flex;font-size:10pt;margin-top:4.5pt;justify-content:flex-start;font-family:Arial;align-items:baseline;margin-bottom:0;min-width:3.333%;text-align:justify;"><span style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:10pt;font-family:Times New Roman;font-kerning:none;min-width:3.5356267702001714%;word-break:keep-all;display:inline-flex;justify-content:flex-start;">&#8226;</span><div style="display:inline;"><span style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;">Frontier and support services revenue increased $166 million or 2% driven by growth in Customer Success Support, offset in part by a decline in Frontier Company.</span></div></div><p style="tab-size:26.66px;font-size:10pt;margin-top:9pt;font-family:Arial;margin-bottom:0;text-align:justify;"><span style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;">Operating income increased $16.4 billion or 17%.</span></p><div class="item-list-element-wrapper" style="margin-left:5.731%;tab-size:32px;display:flex;font-size:10pt;margin-top:4.5pt;justify-content:flex-start;font-family:Arial;align-items:baseline;margin-bottom:0;min-width:3.333%;text-align:justify;"><span style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:10pt;font-family:Times New Roman;font-kerning:none;min-width:3.5356267702001714%;word-break:keep-all;display:inline-flex;justify-content:flex-start;">&#8226;</span><div style="display:inline;"><span style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;">Cost of revenue increased $13.2 billion or 27% driven by growth in Azure and Microsoft 365 commercial cloud.</span></div></div><div class="item-list-element-wrapper" style="margin-left:5.731%;tab-size:32px;display:flex;font-size:10pt;margin-top:4.5pt;justify-content:flex-start;font-family:Arial;align-items:baseline;margin-bottom:0;min-width:3.333%;text-align:justify;"><span style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:10pt;font-family:Times New Roman;font-kerning:none;min-width:3.5356267702001714%;word-break:keep-all;display:inline-flex;justify-content:flex-start;">&#8226;</span><div style="display:inline;"><span style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;">Gross margin increased $18.7 billion or 13% driven by growth in Azure and Microsoft 365 commercial cloud. Gross margin percentage decreased driven by the impact of scaling our AI infrastructure, offset in part by efficiency gains in Azure and Microsoft 365 commercial cloud.</span></div></div><div class="item-list-element-wrapper" style="margin-left:5.731%;tab-size:32px;display:flex;font-size:10pt;margin-top:4.5pt;justify-content:flex-start;font-family:Arial;align-items:baseline;margin-bottom:0;min-width:3.333%;text-align:justify;"><span style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:10pt;font-family:Times New Roman;font-kerning:none;min-width:3.5356267702001714%;word-break:keep-all;display:inline-flex;justify-content:flex-start;">&#8226;</span><div style="display:inline;"><span style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;">Operating expenses increased $2.3 billion or 5% driven by investments in cloud and AI engineering and commercial sales.</span></div></div><p style="tab-size:26.66px;font-size:10pt;margin-top:13.5pt;font-family:Arial;margin-bottom:0;text-align:left;"><span style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial;font-style:italic;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;">Devices and Consumer</span></p><p style="tab-size:26.66px;font-size:10pt;margin-top:9pt;font-family:Arial;margin-bottom:0;text-align:justify;"><span style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;">Revenue increased $4.7 billion or 8%.</span></p><div class="item-list-element-wrapper" style="margin-left:5.731%;tab-size:32px;display:flex;font-size:10pt;margin-top:4.5pt;justify-content:flex-start;font-family:Arial;align-items:baseline;margin-bottom:0;min-width:3.333%;text-align:justify;"><span style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:10pt;font-family:Times New Roman;font-kerning:none;min-width:3.5356267702001714%;word-break:keep-all;display:inline-flex;justify-content:flex-start;">&#8226;</span><div style="display:inline;"><span style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;">Search and advertising revenue increased $2.5 billion or 13%. Search and advertising revenue excluding traffic acquisition costs increased 17% driven by higher volume and rate across LinkedIn, Edge, and Bing.</span></div></div><div class="item-list-element-wrapper" style="margin-left:5.731%;tab-size:32px;display:flex;font-size:10pt;margin-top:4.5pt;justify-content:flex-start;font-family:Arial;align-items:baseline;margin-bottom:0;min-width:3.333%;text-align:justify;"><span style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:10pt;font-family:Times New Roman;font-kerning:none;min-width:3.5356267702001714%;word-break:keep-all;display:inline-flex;justify-content:flex-start;">&#8226;</span><div style="display:inline;"><span style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;">XBOX revenue increased $2.0 billion or 9% driven by growth in XBOX content and services, offset in part by a decline in XBOX hardware. XBOX content and services revenue increased 16% driven by the impact of the Activision Blizzard acquisition and XBOX Game Pass. XBOX hardware revenue decreased 25% driven by lower volume of consoles sold.</span></div></div><div class="item-list-element-wrapper" style="margin-left:5.731%;tab-size:32px;display:flex;font-size:10pt;margin-top:4.5pt;justify-content:flex-start;font-family:Arial;align-items:baseline;margin-bottom:0;min-width:3.333%;text-align:justify;"><span style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:10pt;font-family:Times New Roman;font-kerning:none;min-width:3.5356267702001714%;word-break:keep-all;display:inline-flex;justify-content:flex-start;">&#8226;</span><div style="display:inline;"><span style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;">Windows OEM and devices revenue increased $285 million or 2% driven by growth in Windows OEM, offset in part by a decline in devices. </span></div></div><p style="tab-size:26.66px;font-size:10pt;margin-top:9pt;font-family:Arial;margin-bottom:0;text-align:justify;"><span style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;">Operating income increased $2.7 billion or 18%.</span></p><div class="item-list-element-wrapper" style="margin-left:5.731%;tab-size:32px;display:flex;font-size:10pt;margin-top:4.5pt;justify-content:flex-start;font-family:Arial;align-items:baseline;margin-bottom:0;min-width:3.333%;text-align:justify;"><span style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:10pt;font-family:Times New Roman;font-kerning:none;min-width:3.5356267702001714%;word-break:keep-all;display:inline-flex;justify-content:flex-start;">&#8226;</span><div style="display:inline;"><span style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;">Cost of revenue increased $529 million or 2% driven by growth in Search and advertising.</span></div></div><div class="item-list-element-wrapper" style="margin-left:5.731%;tab-size:32px;display:flex;font-size:10pt;margin-top:4.5pt;justify-content:flex-start;font-family:Arial;align-items:baseline;margin-bottom:0;min-width:3.333%;text-align:justify;"><span style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:10pt;font-family:Times New Roman;font-kerning:none;min-width:3.5356267702001714%;word-break:keep-all;display:inline-flex;justify-content:flex-start;">&#8226;</span><div style="display:inline;"><span style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;">Gross margin increased $4.2 billion or 13% with growth across all businesses. Gross margin percentage increased with improvement across all businesses.</span></div></div><div class="item-list-element-wrapper" style="margin-left:5.731%;tab-size:32px;display:flex;font-size:10pt;margin-top:4.5pt;justify-content:flex-start;font-family:Arial;align-items:baseline;margin-bottom:0;min-width:3.333%;text-align:justify;"><span style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:10pt;font-family:Times New Roman;font-kerning:none;min-width:3.5356267702001714%;word-break:keep-all;display:inline-flex;justify-content:flex-start;">&#8226;</span><div style="display:inline;"><span style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;">Operating expenses increased $1.5 billion or 8% primarily driven by XBOX, including the impact of the Activision Blizzard acquisition.</span></div></div><p style="tab-size:26.66px;font-size:9pt;margin-top:0;font-family:Arial;margin-bottom:0;text-align:justify;"><span style="white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:9pt;font-family:Arial;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;">&#160;</span></p><p style="tab-size:26.66px;font-size:10pt;margin-top:0;font-family:Times New Roman;margin-bottom:0;text-align:left;"><span style="white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:10pt;font-family:Times New Roman;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;">&#160;</span></p></div>
