gn withholding taxes were presented net of foreign tax credits.</span></ix:footnote></div></div><div class="item-list-element-wrapper" style="tab-size:32px;display:flex;font-size:10pt;margin-top:0;justify-content:flex-start;font-family:Arial;align-items:baseline;margin-bottom:0;min-width:4.537%;text-align:justify;"><span style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial;font-kerning:none;min-width:4.537%;word-break:keep-all;display:inline-flex;justify-content:flex-start;">(c)</span><div style="display:inline;"><ix:footnote id="FNT_c64026f8-dba8-4b78-a147-3e2309368886" xml:lang="en-US"><span style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial;font-style:italic;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;">Under ASU 2023-09, we elected to present the effect of cross-border tax laws gross and present the foreign tax credits related to GILTI within the Tax credits category.</span></ix:footnote></div></div><div class="item-list-element-wrapper" style="tab-size:32px;display:flex;font-size:10pt;margin-top:0;justify-content:flex-start;font-family:Arial;align-items:baseline;margin-bottom:0;min-width:4.537%;text-align:justify;"><span style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial;font-kerning:none;min-width:4.537%;word-break:keep-all;display:inline-flex;justify-content:flex-start;">(d)</span><div style="display:inline;"><ix:footnote id="FNT_a5e8f8b5-6064-4c31-94ca-3fead3fd5f6d" xml:lang="en-US"><span style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial;font-style:italic;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;">Includes changes in unrecognized tax benefits on an aggregated basis for all jurisdictions, including interest and penalties.</span></ix:footnote></div></div><p style="tab-size:26.66px;font-size:10pt;margin-top:9pt;font-family:Arial;margin-bottom:0;text-align:justify;"><span style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial;font-kerning:none;min-width: