rtain Tax Positions</span></p><p style="tab-size:26.66px;font-size:10pt;margin-top:9pt;font-family:Arial;margin-bottom:0;text-align:justify;"><span style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;">Gross unrecognized tax benefits related to uncertain tax positions as of June 30, 2026, 2025, and 2024, were $</span><span style="font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial;color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;"><ix:nonFraction id="F_15831c2f-3ffe-4139-b0cc-67aa983080fe" contextRef="C_8b89d828-75f8-4f14-937d-9ec8f5b9f8fc" name="us-gaap:UnrecognizedTaxBenefits" unitRef="U_USD" scale="9" decimals="-8" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal">25.8</ix:nonFraction></span><span style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;"> billion, $</span><span style="font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial;color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;"><ix:nonFraction id="F_3e25b8a5-b5b0-4819-aa47-3ff65f666436" contextRef="C_34dc2009-5c47-4d6e-beb2-0af146fbbfb2" name="us-gaap:UnrecognizedTaxBenefits" unitRef="U_USD" scale="9" decimals="-8" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal">24.7</ix:nonFraction></span><span style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;"> billion, and $</span><span style="font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial;color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;"><ix:nonFraction id="F_2e9531e6-cfcd-4113-b159-5fb616702b15" contextRef="C_ec65dff0-95bd-4497-88c3-0adf808915cf" name="us-gaap:UnrecognizedTaxBenefits" unitRef="U_USD" scale="9" decimals="-8" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal">22.8</ix:nonFraction></span><span style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;"> billion, respectively, which were primarily included in long-term income taxes in our consolida