  <div class="main-content-container" style="z-index:5;position:relative;"><div><ix:continuation id="F_cb8b67ec-422c-42c7-9787-31179f7eb2aa_4"><p style="tab-size:26.66px;font-size:10pt;margin-top:9pt;font-family:Arial;margin-bottom:0;text-align:justify;"><span style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;">We are subject to income tax in many jurisdictions outside the U.S., some of which are currently under audit by local tax authorities. The resolution of these audits is not expected to be material to our consolidated financial statements. Our operations in Ireland remain subject to examination for tax years </span><span style="font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial;"><span style="-sec-ix-hidden:F_4820aa18-e626-4f65-a47b-fed3ce077714;"><span style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;">2021 and thereafter</span></span></span><span style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;">.</span></p></ix:continuation></div><div style="font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial;"><ix:nonNumeric id="F_fdad6bdc-7618-4637-a0ed-1153d749b886" contextRef="C_cc83aaed-4c2b-47e2-a694-c8c5f5fe3b56" name="us-gaap:RevenueFromContractWithCustomerTextBlock" escape="true"><p style="tab-size:26.66px;font-size:10pt;margin-top:13.5pt;font-family:Arial;margin-bottom:0;text-align:center;"><span style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;text-decoration:underline solid;font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;">NOTE 12 &#8212; UNEARNED REVENUE</span><span style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;"> </span></p><p style="tab-size:26.66px;font-size:10pt;margin-top:9pt;font-family:Arial;margin-bottom:0;text-align:justify;"><span style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;">Substantially all unearned revenue relates to the Agents and Infra segment.</span><span style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;"> </span></p><div style="font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial;"><ix:nonNumeric id="F_47053e84-8b00-44cd-ad7d-a129975aa1f8" contextRef="C_cc83aaed-4c2b-47e2-a694-c8c5f5fe3b56" name="us-gaap:ContractWithCustomerAssetAndLiabilityTableTextBlock" escape="true"><p style="tab-size:26.66px;font-size:10pt;margin-top:9pt;font-family:Arial;margin-bottom:0;text-align:justify;"><span style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;">Changes in unearned revenue were as follows:</span><span style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;">                                                                 </span></p><p style="tab-size:26.66px;font-size:9pt;margin-top:0;font-family:Arial;margin-bottom:0;text-align:justify;"><span style="white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:9pt;font-family:Arial;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;">&#160;</span></p>
